## Completion posture

<%= poc_estimate(snapshot.fetch("summary")) %> · <%= snapshot.dig("summary", "requirement_count") %> unique active requirements. <%= poc_counts(snapshot.fetch("summary")) %>.

Implementation, recorded verification and recorded acceptance are distinct; this derived view grants no authority. Unknown evidence is not a pass or a remaining-effort forecast.

## Major elements

<%= poc_table(["Element", "Posture", "Recorded stages"], snapshot.fetch("elements").map { |row| [row.fetch("title"), poc_estimate(row.fetch("summary")), poc_counts(row.fetch("summary"))] }) %>

## Leadership attention

<% attention = snapshot.fetch("attention").select { |row| row.fetch("state") == "ACTIONABLE_NOW" } -%>
<%= attention.empty? ? "No currently actionable decision is recorded." : poc_table(["Decision", "Owner", "Recommendation"], attention.map { |row| [row.fetch("question"), row.fetch("owner"), row.fetch("recommendation", "Not recorded")] }) %>

## Current blockers

<%= snapshot.fetch("blockers").empty? ? "No active blocker is recorded. Missing evidence remains unknown." : poc_table(["Blocker", "State"], snapshot.fetch("blockers").map { |row| [row.fetch("title"), row.fetch("state")] }) %>

